cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use PyRATS in your research, please cite it as below. PyRATS drives
  BRATS, synchrofit and pysynch; please also cite those packages and the
  papers describing them (see README.md, "Citing").
title: PyRATS
abstract: >-
  Spectral ageing and energetics of extended radio sources: common-beam
  regridding, integrated SEDs, a six-model spectral-ageing ensemble,
  equipartition and minimum-energy magnetic fields, and resolved
  spectral-index and spectral-age maps, with BRATS and synchrofit run on the
  same pixel grid and error model.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Dutta
    given-names: Sushant
version: 2.1.0
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
keywords:
  - radio astronomy
  - synchrotron
  - spectral ageing
  - equipartition
  - radio galaxies
